@startuml
title P1 Windows local self-test and brokered file intake

skinparam shadowing false

component "Later Windows UI integration" as UI
component "WindowsLocalSelfTestService\nexact 5 s + generations" as SelfTest
component "WindowsMicrophoneCaptureService\nself_test media class" as Capture
component "WindowsProductionLocalClipOutput\nlocal schedule; reports disabled" as LocalOutput
component "WindowsOverlayMediaClipMixer\nproduction clip branch" as Mixer
database "CaptureMediaStore\nself-tests + opaque drafts" as Store
component "Broker-authorized stream\npicker or drop adapter" as Broker
component "WindowsShortAudioInspector\ncontent + limits" as Inspector
component "WindowsShortAudioIntake\ncanonical PCM16" as Intake
cloud "Coordinator / upload / telemetry" as Network

UI --> SelfTest : cue / record / close / delete
SelfTest --> Capture : explicit self-test capture
Capture --> Store : partial -> self_test_local
Capture --> LocalOutput : start and stop cues
SelfTest --> LocalOutput : completed recording
LocalOutput --> Mixer : direct prepare + arm

UI --> Broker : OS-granted file access
Broker --> Inspector : fresh bounded stream
Inspector --> Intake : eligible strict WAV
Intake --> Store : opaque durable draft

SelfTest .. Network : no dependency
LocalOutput .. Network : no MediaClipClient

note right of Broker
No broad filesystem capability.
No external path crosses the seam.
end note

note bottom of Network
Server probing remains authoritative only after
a later explicit upload; Try locally never calls it.
end note

@enduml
